jewels of gold, which ye return him for a trespass offering, in a coffer by the side thereof; and send it away, that it may go.¦layout ªlast_verse„¥verse	¯paragraph_startÂ¥lines‘‚¤textÙÕAnd see, if it goeth up by the way of his own coast to Beth-shemesh, then he hath done us this great evil: but if not, then we shall know that it is not his hand that smote us: it was a chance that happened to us.¦layout ªlast_verse	…¤book§chapter«first_verse
